msgid "1. Import the test-signal WAV on a new track of your DAW project.\n2. Route that track to the monitors (or the loudspeaker you want to test).\n3. Arm a second track with the measurement microphone and record while the test signal plays.\n4. Export / bounce the recorded track as a WAV file at the project sample rate.\n   Do not trim it - RoomScope finds the sweep automatically.\nStart with a low monitor level; the sweep should be clearly audible but not loud."
msgstr "1. 把测试信号 WAV 导入 DAW 项目的新轨道。\n2. 将该轨道路由到监听（或要测的扬声器）。\n3. 用测量话筒武装第二条轨道，在测试信号播放时录音。\n4. 按工程采样率导出/bounce 为 WAV。\n   不要裁切——RoomScope 会自动找到扫描。\n先把监听开低；扫描应清楚可闻，但不要很大声。"

